SUMMARY:Panigiri of Panagia Poulariani
LOCATION:Poulariani (east Astypalaia)\, Astypalaia\, Greece
DESCRIPTION:The Nativity of the Virgin is kept at the cave chapel of Panagia Poulariani on the eastern arm of the island beyond Vathy\, with vespers on the 7th and a small feast with violins after. Reached by dirt road or boat from Vathy\; ask locally about lifts.\n\nhttps://aegeanblueprint.com/festivals/astypalaia/#poulariani-east-astypalaia-panigiri-of-panagia-poulariani
